    <title>VOL08：从今天开始我将全职登山</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d0aeceb42db19129eafbea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d0aeceb42db19129eafbea</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Aug 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听《林荫中街》！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目对话2014级同学冯昱鹏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>回望老冯从林荫出国，于卡耐基·梅隆大学毕业后加入知名房地产公司龙湖集团，在全身心投入工作数年之后，认清世界的真相仍然保持着强烈的热爱，毅然选择辞职，决定全身心投入职业登山的十年成长之路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《林荫中街》登山篇，不设时间码，因为每一分钟都足够精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想直接聆听老冯“为何辞去高薪工作转向职业登山”的朋友，可从 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 开始收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：本期节目全程由四川话录制。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>宗原（成都七中2014届）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一乔（成都七中2014届）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>冯昱鹏（成都七中2014届15班）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：@攀山的冯喜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>返场嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>朱宸骁（成都七中2014届8班）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：@Shawn（小红书号：1100292708）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>冯昱鹏攀岩/登山照</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8rbsJAMifpoJR61Hyd5SZn9Ovm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FktANAf8fqHQxUMRbf6PeR2Fqhsa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlT22GVG87C-hQUbhq45Jt3KV6ii.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOL33RKtanTVYceH39O0IINjp_l.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3YObpM6SP-LS9ZJo6Rdz8cgQIR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎有兴趣与我们分享林荫精彩故事、加入播客听友群的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加主播微信【zongyuan1995】</span></p><span></span><p><span>让告别林荫中街的我们，重新在《林荫中街》播客中相聚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客logo设计：冯昱鹏（成都七中2014届）</span></p>]]></description>
